From 70281d4b3d87d07490aa39d9fa3ed13d5a4334d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: eileenthg <40307498+eileenthg@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 00:48:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Point cheese tags at Brewin & Chewin

Cheesemaking has moved to Brewin & Chewin, so ED's own cheese items are
removed from c:foods/cheese and c:foods/goat_cheese and replaced with
B&C's wedges.

Every cheese-consuming recipe in ED (mac and cheese, grilled cheese,
cranberry goat cheese toast, honeyed goat cheese tart, goat cheese
beetroot salad, asparagus frittata, ...) takes cheese through these two
tags rather than a concrete item, so this one change retargets all of
them at once with no recipe edits. The recipes themselves stay in ED
because they depend on ED-only ingredients.

Entries are addOptional so ED still loads standalone; the tags are simply
empty without B&C, which pairs with Item Obliterator hiding ED's now
unobtainable cheese items.

The two generated tag files were updated by hand rather than by datagen.
runData cannot run on this repo: src/main/templates/ does not exist, so
generateModMetadata produces nothing, and the tracked raw
src/main/resources/META-INF/neoforge.mods.toml is read instead, failing
with "Invalid bare key: '${mod_id}'". That is a pre-existing workspace
bug unrelated to this change. The hand-written output matches byte for
byte what ItemTagsProvider emits for addOptional. Re-running datagen
after that build issue is fixed should be a no-op.

Verified: the module compiles (warnings only, no errors). Not yet tested
in game.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../resources/data/c/tags/item/foods/cheese.json         | 9 ++++++++-
 .../resources/data/c/tags/item/foods/goat_cheese.json    | 5 ++++-
 .../java/ianm1647/expandeddelight/data/EDItemTags.java   | 8 ++++++--
 3 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/generated/resources/data/c/tags/item/foods/cheese.json b/src/generated/resources/data/c/tags/item/foods/cheese.json
index 2c457c7..35d639f 100644
--- a/src/generated/resources/data/c/tags/item/foods/cheese.json
+++ b/src/generated/resources/data/c/tags/item/foods/cheese.json
@@ -1,5 +1,12 @@
 {
   "values": [
-    "expandeddelight:cheese_slice"
+    {
+      "id": "brewinandchewin:flaxen_cheese_wedge",
+      "required": false
+    },
+    {
+      "id": "brewinandchewin:scarlet_cheese_wedge",
+      "required": false
+    }
   ]
 }
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/src/generated/resources/data/c/tags/item/foods/goat_cheese.json b/src/generated/resources/data/c/tags/item/foods/goat_cheese.json
index 9efbb2c..980ea72 100644
--- a/src/generated/resources/data/c/tags/item/foods/goat_cheese.json
+++ b/src/generated/resources/data/c/tags/item/foods/goat_cheese.json
@@ -1,6 +1,9 @@
 {
   "values": [
-    "expandeddelight:goat_cheese_slice",
+    {
+      "id": "brewinandchewin:goat_cheese_wedge",
+      "required": false
+    },
     {
       "id": "hearthandharvest:goat_cheese_slice",
       "required": false
diff --git a/src/main/java/ianm1647/expandeddelight/data/EDItemTags.java b/src/main/java/ianm1647/expandeddelight/data/EDItemTags.java
index 115d36c..14754ab 100644
--- a/src/main/java/ianm1647/expandeddelight/data/EDItemTags.java
+++ b/src/main/java/ianm1647/expandeddelight/data/EDItemTags.java
@@ -172,10 +172,14 @@ public class EDItemTags extends ItemTagsProvider {
         tag(EDCommonTags.FOODS_SWEET_POTATO).add(EDItems.SWEET_POTATO.get());
         tag(EDCommonTags.FOODS_CHILI_PEPPER).add(EDItems.CHILI_PEPPER.get());
         tag(EDCommonTags.FOODS_PEANUT).add(EDItems.PEANUT.get());
+        // Cheesemaking migrated to Brewin & Chewin. ED's own cheese items are no longer
+        // part of these tags; every ED recipe below consumes cheese through the tag, so
+        // they now resolve to B&C's wedges instead.
         tag(EDCommonTags.FOODS_CHEESE)
-                .add(EDItems.CHEESE_SLICE.get());
+                .addOptional(ResourceLocation.fromNamespaceAndPath("brewinandchewin", "flaxen_cheese_wedge"))
+                .addOptional(ResourceLocation.fromNamespaceAndPath("brewinandchewin", "scarlet_cheese_wedge"));
         tag(EDCommonTags.FOODS_GOAT_CHEESE)
-                .add(EDItems.GOAT_CHEESE_SLICE.get())
+                .addOptional(ResourceLocation.fromNamespaceAndPath("brewinandchewin", "goat_cheese_wedge"))
                 .addOptional(ResourceLocation.fromNamespaceAndPath("hearthandharvest", "goat_cheese_slice"));
         //jams
         tag(EDCommonTags.JAMS)
